# Grow Extra Arms ({1}{G}): "This spell costs {1} less to cast if it targets a Spider." The increase is added before the reduction
# is taken off (CR 601.2f), so with Bot1's Sphere of Resistance ("Spells cost {1} more to cast") the total on a Spider is
# {1}{G}+{1}-{1} = {1}{G}: the {G}{R} of Mox Emerald and Mox Ruby pay it exactly. It takes one off, not two - two would leave
# only {G} and the {R} unspent.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Sphere of Resistance
Radioactive Spider
Grow Extra Arms
Forest x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

