Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Sphere of Resistance.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Radioactive Spider.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Grow Extra Arms.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Radioactive Spider)
